--[[
    GR33D EXPLOIT
      • Super Ring Old logic (BodyPosition orbit)
      • Multi-select targeting — ring orbits nearest selected player
      • Fly GUI / Anti-Fling / FPS Boost
      • Target countdown only advances on observed object orbital movement
      • User-provided working Super Ring scanner/BodyPosition target logic, max scan 3,000 studs
      • One clear overall grab status: searching / tracking / orbit observed / error
      • Direct-part collection via one spherical scan; near-first ordering
      • Explicit ON/OFF and separate orbit-center lock; no accidental 3-state cycling
      • Fresh 3,000-stud scan requested immediately on activation
      • Original source movement restored; status counts found / tracked / moving / orbit
      • No stationary-part eviction or blacklist during operation
      • Green draggable G launcher • mobile-friendly player list
      • Selected-target fling only (no Mass Fling / Mass Ring)
      • No loadstrings anywhere
      • Passive 0.6-second Grab Stability Monitor (no motor or scanner modifications)
      • Recent movement, history-priority sampling, stalled-object alerts, monitor toggle
]]

